<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 206 0 R
/E (The findings demonstrate that the AI-Powered Business Analytics and Sales Forecasting System can effectively transform raw business data into meaningful insights that support strategic decision-making. The system successfully integrates sales analytics, inventory monitoring, customer management, forecasting, and reporting within a single platform, reducing the need for manual analysis. The forecasting results help businesses anticipate future demand, optimize inventory levels, and improve resource planning. Furthermore, the interactive dashboards and automated reports enhance operational efficiency, increase business visibility, and enable organizations to make faster, data-driven decisions. These outcomes highlight the potential of analytics and artificial intelligence technologies in improving business performance, profitability, and long-term growth.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
